    {
        "content": "<p><a href=\"https://github.com/AlexKontorovich/PrimeNumberTheoremAnd/pull/1414\">PNT#1414</a> applies <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"243791\">@David Renshaw</span>'s fix.  We won't know if it works until its merged because we don't build the docs on a PR.</p>",
